{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111631","id":2912715234,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6tnIHi","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111631","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111631.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111631.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111631","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111631/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111631/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111631/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a2f49a1676608b29a0ce39fe20bc43119b609008","number":111631,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add FSR3 Upscaler support","user":{"login":"HydrogenC","id":33123710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTIzNzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33123710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC","html_url":"https://github.com/HydrogenC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n## Overview\r\nThis PR only introduces FSR3 **UPSCALER**, which means **FRAME GENERATION** is irrelevant. In FSR 3.1, upscaler and frame gen is fully decoupled, so we can introduce either of them independently of the other. \r\n\r\nThis PR adds support for Fidelity Super Resolution (FSR) 3.1.4 on top of the common Fidelity FX interface introduced in #111512 .  \r\nThe PR also contains improvements to and update to FSR1/2 and fundamental changes to the FSR interface, see description in #111512. \r\n\r\nWhen the upscale multiplier is large (rendered/upscaled<0.7), you may expect glitches on faraway objects. Such glitches are also seem on the existing FSR2. This is a algorithm limitation of the FSR temporal upscaling, not likely a artifact caused by the implementation of this PR. \r\n\r\n## Improvement to FSR2\r\nThis PR adds a new option called \"FSR auto generate reactive mask\". If checked, FSR 2/3 will also run an additional reactive mask generation mask, which considerably reduces the flickering when dealing with transparent objects. The pass takes an opaque-only color attachment as input, so the color attachment is copied and saved between opaque render and transparent render. The additional pass could also be enabled for and benefit the existing FSR2 effect. The stabilization is quite conspicuous, for both FSR 2 and 3 (see comparison in [comment below](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111631#issuecomment-3409279370)). \r\n\r\n## Tests\r\nTested on Windows Vulkan & DX12, other platforms untested. \r\n\r\n## Benchmarks\r\n|               | FSR2 2x | FSR3 2x | FSR2 Native | FSR3 Native |\r\n|---------------|-----------|-----------|-----------|-----------|\r\n| GPU Time (ms) | 0.27      | 0.33      | 0.41      | 0.47      |\r\n| Visuals | <img width=\"721\" height=\"574\" alt=\"FSR2\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d82ec710-272a-44c7-b1ef-0a537622f36b\" /> | <img width=\"720\" height=\"579\" alt=\"FSR3\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e865d13d-6a73-478a-af9b-61949c2ae029\" /> |  |  |\r\n\r\n\r\n## Todos\r\n - [x] Investigate and fix occasional crash - Solved\r\n - [x] Transparent objects flickers quite worse - Solved","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","description":"","color":"b64245","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.co